ited = new boolean[n + 1];\n        List<Integer> adj = new ArrayList<>(n + 1);\n        for (int i = 0; i <= n; i++) {\n            adj.add(-1);\n        }\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            int next = (i * k) % n;\n            adj.set(i + 1, next);\n        }\n\n        int pairs = 0;\n        for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {\n            if (!visited[i]) {\n                dfs(i, adj, visited);\n                pairs++;\n            }\n        }\n        if (k == 1) {\n            System.out.println(pow(n, n, mod));\n        } else {\n            System.out.println(pow(n, pairs, mod));\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void dfs(int n, List<Integer> adj, boolean[] visited) {\n        visited[n] = true;\n        while (!visited[adj.get(n)]) {\n            n = adj.get(n);\n            visited[n] = true;\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static long pow(long x, long y, long mod) {\n        if (y == 0) {\n            return 1;\n        }\n        if (y % 2 == 0) {\n            long temp = pow(x, y / 2, mod);\n            return (temp * temp) % mod;\n        } else {\n            long temp = pow(x, y / 2, mod);\n            return ((temp * temp) % mod * x) % mod;\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n<confidence>\n0.9\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.6373801231384277, -0.0027767191641032696, -0.00011897795047843829, -0.09180450439453125, -1.120573597290786e-05, -0.6931922435760498, -1.0401465892791748, -0.0027565169148147106, -2.9921979148639366e-05, -0.00576617568731308, -0.25344106554985046, -0.0024488726630806923, -0.0008611810044385493, -0.056087080389261246, -0.00922487210482359, -0.6515951156616211, -0.003436024533584714, -8.511905616614968e-05, -0.0001326887431787327, -0.00019844355119857937, -1.4305124977909145e-06, -8.463895028398838e-06, -0.06640921533107758, -0.15503768622875214, -0.0002510266494937241, -1.9312092263135128e-05, -0.2565099000930786, -0.1000298261642456, -1.1920930376163597e-07, -1.1920930376163597e-07, -1.1920930376163597e-07, -